# A quantity on a unit-typed kwarg arrives in the kwarg's unit, converted when
# the call is evaluated ([LADP.8.5.3], [RLOW.7.3.9]).
#
#   Delay k=1    wait=120 s   timer.arm wait=2, FN_INT_DIV_EXACT by 60e9 ns,
#                             and the log line runs
#   Delay k=2    wait=90 s    NOT_REPRESENTABLE: the activation is abandoned,
#                             no call, no log, and the engine goes on
#   Reading k=1  t=293.15 K   hvac.set t=20.0, (base - 273.15), and h=40.0,
#                             (base - 273.15) / 0.5 -- both exact in binary64
#
# FN_INT_DIV_EXACT's zero divisor and null operand cannot be written in source
# (the divisor is a unit's factor, and a `call` argument is never nullable), so
# test_rete_time and test_ds pin those two in each runtime.
# @spec [RLOW.7.3.9]
assert Delay k=1 wait=120000000000
pump
assert Delay k=2 wait=90000000000
pump
assert Reading k=1 t=293.15
pump
